#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "That record belongs to a Cacti device you do not have permission for. Nothing was changed."
msgstr "Šis ieraksts pieder Cacti ierīcei, kurai jums nav atļaujas. Nekas netika mainīts."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Name: another filesystem of this backend already uses this name."
msgstr "Nosaukums: cita šīs aizmugursistēmas failu sistēma jau izmanto šo nosaukumu."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The filesystem could not be saved."
msgstr "Failu sistēmu nevarēja saglabāt."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The filesystem was saved."
msgstr "Failu sistēma tika saglabāta."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The filesystem, its nodes, and its inventory were deleted. Its Cacti device, data sources, and graphs were kept. No node was contacted."
msgstr "Failu sistēma, tās mezgli un inventārs tika dzēsti. Tās Cacti ierīce, datu avoti un grafiki tika saglabāti. Ar nevienu mezglu netika veidots savienojums."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Name: another node already uses this name."
msgstr "Nosaukums: cits mezgls jau izmanto šo nosaukumu."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The node could not be saved."
msgstr "Mezglu nevarēja saglabāt."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The node was saved."
msgstr "Mezgls tika saglabāts."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The node was deleted. Targets it reported keep their history."
msgstr "Mezgls tika dzēsts. Mērķi, par kuriem tas ziņoja, saglabā savu vēsturi."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Enter a network as an address and prefix length, such as 10.20.0.0/16."
msgstr "Ievadiet tīklu kā adresi un prefiksa garumu, piemēram, 10.20.0.0/16."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "No device was added: the filesystem already has one, or the templates are not installed."
msgstr "Ierīce netika pievienota: failu sistēmai tā jau ir vai veidnes nav instalētas."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device could not be mapped. It may be mapped to another filesystem."
msgstr "Ierīci nevarēja piesaistīt. Tā, iespējams, ir piesaistīta citai failu sistēmai."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device was mapped and the data queries and overview graphs were added."
msgstr "Ierīce tika piesaistīta, un tika pievienoti datu vaicājumi un pārskata grafiki."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Cacti did not create the device. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Cacti neizveidoja ierīci. Skatiet Cacti žurnālu."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device, its data queries, and its overview graphs were created."
msgstr "Ierīce, tās datu vaicājumi un pārskata grafiki tika izveidoti."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device is no longer mapped. It and its graphs were kept; its data queries list no targets until it is mapped again."
msgstr "Ierīce vairs nav piesaistīta. Tā un tās grafiki tika saglabāti; tās datu vaicājumi neuzskaita mērķus, līdz tā atkal tiek piesaistīta."

